# MET-13: copy this file to batch2_idats.path and replace the line below with the
# absolute path to the batch2 IDAT directory on your system. The real .path files
# are gitignored -- their entire content was an internal cluster path and this repo
# is public. Setting BATCH2_IDAT_DIR in the environment bypasses this file entirely.
#
# batch2: the warehouse copy whose <Sentrix_ID>/<Sentrix_ID>_<Sentrix_Position>
# subdirectory layout resolves all 48/48 Grn and 48/48 Red idat files (MET-06).
/replace/with/absolute/path/to/batch2/idats
